    "detailed_description": "<strong>About the game</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576040/extras/183a044f018e438f299c2f3f6860248b.avif?t=1753336111\" width=583 height=300 /></span><br>Dive into an exciting world of enchantment and discovery in our visual novel &quot;Goblin Gangbang \ud83e\udddf\ud83c\udf46\ud83d\udc69&quot;. Immerse yourself in a unique narrative that combines whimsy and intrigue. Explore a hauntingly beautiful beach as you follow the journey of Emilia, a young girl who stumbles upon an unlikely companion in her quest to find her way home.<br><br><strong>Story</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576040/extras/417786f5424f5faf71320cbc094592c3.avif?t=1753336111\" width=582 height=300 /></span><br>Embark on an unforgettable adventure with Emilia, a fearless young girl with a brave heart. Lost and disoriented in a mysterious cave, Emiliafinds herself in a world that is both enchanting and treacherous. As she navigates this otherworldly world, she encounters the fearsome Goblins, whose intentions are still unclear.<br><br>Against the backdrop of the cave, Emilia discovers secrets that intertwine her fate with that of the mysterious Goblins. As their paths intertwine, you'll unravel a story of camaraderie, unexpected alliances, and the resilience of the human spirit.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576040/extras/f2f134285a4d0828888ea2040ed5dfda.avif?t=1753336111\" width=582 height=300 /></span><br>- Engaging Visual Novel: Immerse yourself in a beautifully illustrated world, rich with captivating visuals that bring the story to life.<br>- Compelling Narrative: Navigate through an intricate storyline filled with unexpected twists, as you forge connections with unique characters.<br>- Unveil Mysteries: Discover the secrets hidden within the cave's depths and unearth the truth behind Emilia's journey.<br>- Evolving Characters: Witness Emilia and the Goblin chief undergo transformative journeys, evolving through challenges and unexpected revelations.<br>- HD renders<br>- Intriguing story<br>- Explicit scenes<br>- Can be played with one hand",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>About the game</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576040/extras/183a044f018e438f299c2f3f6860248b.avif?t=1753336111\" width=583 height=300 /></span><br>Dive into an exciting world of enchantment and discovery in our visual novel &quot;Goblin Gangbang \ud83e\udddf\ud83c\udf46\ud83d\udc69&quot;. Immerse yourself in a unique narrative that combines whimsy and intrigue. Explore a hauntingly beautiful beach as you follow the journey of Emilia, a young girl who stumbles upon an unlikely companion in her quest to find her way home.<br><br><strong>Story</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576040/extras/417786f5424f5faf71320cbc094592c3.avif?t=1753336111\" width=582 height=300 /></span><br>Embark on an unforgettable adventure with Emilia, a fearless young girl with a brave heart. Lost and disoriented in a mysterious cave, Emiliafinds herself in a world that is both enchanting and treacherous. As she navigates this otherworldly world, she encounters the fearsome Goblins, whose intentions are still unclear.<br><br>Against the backdrop of the cave, Emilia discovers secrets that intertwine her fate with that of the mysterious Goblins. As their paths intertwine, you'll unravel a story of camaraderie, unexpected alliances, and the resilience of the human spirit.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576040/extras/f2f134285a4d0828888ea2040ed5dfda.avif?t=1753336111\" width=582 height=300 /></span><br>- Engaging Visual Novel: Immerse yourself in a beautifully illustrated world, rich with captivating visuals that bring the story to life.<br>- Compelling Narrative: Navigate through an intricate storyline filled with unexpected twists, as you forge connections with unique characters.<br>- Unveil Mysteries: Discover the secrets hidden within the cave's depths and unearth the truth behind Emilia's journey.<br>- Evolving Characters: Witness Emilia and the Goblin chief undergo transformative journeys, evolving through challenges and unexpected revelations.<br>- HD renders<br>- Intriguing story<br>- Explicit scenes<br>- Can be played with one hand",
